'''''Campylium stellatum''''' is a species of [[moss]] belonging to the family [[Amblystegiaceae]].<ref name="worldfloraonline.org">{{cite web |title=Campylium stellatum (Hedw.) C.E.O. Jensen |url=http://www.worldfloraonline.org/taxon/wfo-0001178354 |website=www.worldfloraonline.org |access-date=31 January 2021}}</ref>

It has [[cosmopolitan distribution]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Campylium stellatum (Hedw.) C.E.O.Jensen |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/4279903 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=31 January 2021 |language=en}}</ref>

